t, Rexona, Sunlight, Sunsilk, Surf, TRESemmé, and Vaseline brand names. Unilever PLC was founded in 1860 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","fullTimeEmployees":93731,"city":"London","country":"United Kingdom","website":"https://www.unilever.com","industry":"Household & Personal Products","sector":"Consumer Defensive"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-24"}